Here's the complete picture — everything you need to build the universal plugin architecture:

---

The Core Insight

Every repo is sovereign. Each runs standalone with its own REST API, can be consumed by any project, and has an optional "native mode" for deep Ọmọ Kọ́dà integration.

The Ọ̀RÍ Dashboard is the primary human interface. It talks only to the Omo-Koda2 Orchestrator. The orchestrator talks to all plugins. Plugins never talk to each other directly.

