---

Native Mode vs HTTP Mode

Factor	Native	HTTP	
Latency	< 1ms	1-50ms	
Throughput	10k+ req/s	1-5k req/s	
Language	Rust only	Any	
Crash isolation	Shared	Isolated	
Use case	Critical path	External, background	

Rule of thumb: Internal critical-path plugins (BIPỌ̀N39, IfáScript, Ritual Codex) → native. External plugins, different languages, independent scaling → HTTP.

